                        "content": "Zafirlukast is prescribed for a client with bronchial asthma. Which laboratory test does the nurse expect to be prescribed before the administration of this medication?",
                        "subjectId": "ad5ab04c79144c0ea9b83385308c3b1d",
                        "difficultyIds": "11797937e327eb6d913faa80427c566b",
                        "difficulty": "考试范围-Analyzing 分析",
                        "textAnalysis": "Rationale:\nZafirlukast is a leukotriene receptor antagonist used in the prophylaxis and long-term treatment of bronchial asthma. Zafirlukast is used with caution in clients with impaired hepatic function. Liver function laboratory tests would be performed to obtain a baseline, and the levels need to be monitored during administration of the medication. It is not necessary to perform the other laboratory tests before administration of the medication.",
                        "id": "1a07987a182643f58b2e281c3500aa3d",
                        "mark": "0",
                        "collectionState": "0"
                    },
                    {
                        "optionList": [
                            {
                                "isRight": "1",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "313f57be32674a38ae8e6b7b8f488931",
                                "content": "Administering the pirbuterol before the beclomethasone"
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "fc77317cd5234960a5d4346053f0f764",
                                "content": "Alternating a single puff of each hourly, beginning with the beclomethasone"
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "aa25e97458464b769e3b3a6e73633e58",
                                "content": "Alternating a single puff of beclomethasone with pirbuterol, repeating the steps"
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "20ec8b823b574d7da40ea4311dbc0d4c",
                                "content": "Administering the pirbuterol, waiting 30 minutes, and administering the beclomethasone"
                            }
                        ],
                        "extJson": {
                            "optionList": [
                                {
                                    "isRight": "1",
                                    "userAnswer": "",
                                    "isSelected": "0",
                                    "id": "313f57be32674a38ae8e6b7b8f488931",
                                    "content": "Administering the pirbuterol before the beclomethasone"
                                },
                                {
                                    "isRight": "0",
                                    "userAnswer": "",
                                    "isSelected": "0",
                                    "id": "fc77317cd5234960a5d4346053f0f764",
                                    "content": "Alternating a single puff of each hourly, beginning with the beclomethasone"
                                },
                                {
                                    "isRight": "0",
                                    "userAnswer": "",
                                    "isSelected": "0",
                                    "id": "aa25e97458464b769e3b3a6e73633e58",
                                    "content": "Alternating a single puff of beclomethasone with pirbuterol, repeating the steps"
                                },
                                {
                                    "isRight": "0",
                                    "userAnswer": "",
                                    "isSelected": "0",
                                    "id": "20ec8b823b574d7da40ea4311dbc0d4c",
                                    "content": "Administering the pirbuterol, waiting 30 minutes, and administering the beclomethasone"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
