                        "type": "0",
                        "version": 0,
                        "content": "The client has a prescription to receive pirbuterol 2 puffs and beclomethasone dipropionate 2 puffs by metered-dose inhaler. The nurse plans to give these medications in which way to ensure effectiveness?",
                        "subjectId": "ad5ab04c79144c0ea9b83385308c3b1d",
                        "difficultyIds": "80db17ea97ed8fdcd1b6b9666390fca1",
                        "difficulty": "考试范围-Applying 应用",
                        "textAnalysis": "Rationale:\nPirbuterol is a bronchodilator. Beclomethasone is a glucocorticoid. Bronchodilators are administered before glucocorticoids when both are to be given on the same time schedule. This allows for widening of the air passages by the bronchodilator, which then makes the glucocorticoid more effective.",
                        "id": "218a3f362b0f4f66b1cbad557bb0885f",
                        "mark": "0",
                        "collectionState": "0"
                    },
                    {
                        "optionList": [
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "332cf6048dcb43a8b74f6809260c51c4",
                                "content": "Take an extra dose if fever develops."
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "2a439d9dd03844319f043dfa0caad0b1",
                                "content": "Take the medication with meals only."
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "1",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "f4cacbb667cd46799ee608d4158a77ad",
                                "content": "Take the tablet with a full glass of water."
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "71172c9e24d341ec97dda4f38b3da12a",
                                "content": "Decrease the amount of daily fluid intake."
                            }
                        ],
                        "extJson": {
                            "optionList": [
                                {
                                    "isRight": "0",
                                    "userAnswer": "",
                                    "isSelected": "0",
                                    "id": "332cf6048dcb43a8b74f6809260c51c4",
                                    "content": "Take an extra dose if fever develops."
                                },
                                {
                                    "isRight": "0",
                                    "userAnswer": "",
                                    "isSelected": "0",
                                    "id": "2a439d9dd03844319f043dfa0caad0b1",
                                    "content": "Take the medication with meals only."
                                },
                                {
                                    "isRight": "1",
                                    "userAnswer": "",
                                    "isSelected": "0",
                                    "id": "f4cacbb667cd46799ee608d4158a77ad",
                                    "content": "Take the tablet with a full glass of water."
                                },
                                {
                                    "isRight": "0",
                                    "userAnswer": "",
                                    "isSelected": "0",
                                    "id": "71172c9e24d341ec97dda4f38b3da12a",
                                    "content": "Decrease the amount of daily fluid intake."
                                }
                            ]
                        },
